@host = http://localhost:5097

### Clean ad -> approved
POST {{host}}/check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Fresh sourdough bread baked every morning. Visit our bakery on Main Street." }

### Risky ad -> rejected (gambling)
POST {{host}}/check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Sign up now and get 100 free spins at our online casino." }

### Ambiguous ad -> needs_review (human in the loop)
POST {{host}}/check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Tactical knives for every adventure, 30% off." }

### Blocked by guardrails: not HTTPS, IP address host -> 400
POST {{host}}/check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imageUrl": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data" }
